      "keypoint": "Workflow concurrency",
      "mechanism": "The `permanent-pc-research-loop.yml` workflow runs on both a cron schedule (`*/30 * * * *`) and on pushes to master. A push that occurs while a scheduled run is still executing can launch a second concurrent worker instance, leading to race conditions on shared evidence files or the operational state JSON.",
